A Revelator has perceived an impossible relationship between two psychic faculties that ordinary minds treat as separate. The two Powers are not merely tools used together: in the altered mind they are evidence of one deeper correspondence, and stable advancement comes from making effects that can exist only because both sides of that correspondence are simultaneously true. Individually, those faculties begin as Basic Psi. Before Mastery, ordinary Advanced expressions of either faculty remain temporary possibilities reached through Wild Ability; the stable thing is the conjunction.

